r 10th, we will update this notice to include the [b]Community Vote Winners[\/b] so make sure to join [url=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/aion2official\"]\\[Discord][\/url]\u00a0to vote for your favorite submission from each category from the winners below! [\/p][p][\/p][h2][u]Beauty of Atreia (The World)[\/u][\/h2][p]The first week was all about places that made you stop in wonder.[\/p][table equalcells=\"1\" colwidth=\"222,467\"][tr][th colwidth=\"222\"][p]\u200bWinner[\/p][\/th][th colwidth=\"467\"][p]Submission[\/p][\/th][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"222\"][p]\u200b[b]Region:[\/b] EU\n[b]Server:[\/b] Vaizel\n[b]Character[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name:[\/b] Rinko[\/p][\/td][td colwidth=\"467\"][p]\u200b[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/2e7dc7828e7d6fd5a11c840306cd08ddd3658461.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"222\"][p]\u200b[b]Region[\/b]: EU\n[b]Server[\/b]: Azphel\n[b]Character Name[\/b]: ImyTan[\/p][\/td][td colwidth=\"467\"][p]\u200b[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/f20125fd25943c2da0cd9c01e66e564807d389ad.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"222\"][p][b]\u200bRegion:[\/b] NA East\n[b]Server:[\/b] Azphel\n[b]Character Name:[\/b] Jeaniebeanie[\/p][\/td][td colwidth=\"467\"][p]\u200b[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/70f7d586696605fb03ac033fd2fc6da407725d23.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"222\"][p][b]\u200bRegion:[\/b] EU \n[b]Server:[\/b] Kaisinel\n[b]Character Name:[\/b] Asperatus[\/p][\/td][td colwidth=\"467\"][p]\u200b[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/73c8b07600b611554930f76f1152778074323f24.png\"][\/img]  [\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"222\"][p][b]\u200bRegion:[\/b] NA East\n[b]Server:[\/b] Zikel\n[b]Character Name:[\/b] Cyntais[\/p][\/td][td colwidth=\"467\"][p]\u200b[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/ad90fc00ed9d11f3f979f4b4262d82279330ee80.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][\/table][p][\/p][h2][u]Beauty of Atreia (Character)[\/u][\/h2][p]The second week was about showing off your characters. (This was our favorite!)[\/p][table equalcells=\"1\" colwidth=\"185,\"][tr][th colwidth=\"185\"][p]Winner[\/p][\/th][th][p]Submission[\/p][\/th][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"185\"][p]\u200b[b]Region: [\/b]NA East[b]\nServer: [\/b]Nezekan[b]\nCharacter[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name: [\/b]Verity[\/p][\/td][td][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/a0b733d4aedff8615b12ce9ff63ca96db8482723.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"185\"][p]\u200b[b]Region:[\/b] South America\n[b]Server: [\/b]Zikel \n[b]Character[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name: [\/b]\u6211[\/p][\/td][td][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/0a8f2830fa009b72b0082e420b6556e7d213c27f.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"185\"][p]\u200b[b]Region:[\/b] EU\n[b]Server: [\/b]Nemon \n[b]Character[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name: [\/b]Kalipso[\/p][\/td][td][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/a168421b05bd6b88f5acd19f3b40b7f2f641aea4.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"185\"][p]\u200b[b]Region:[\/b] NA East[\/p][p][b]Server: [\/b]Nezekan[\/p][p][b]Character[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name: [\/b]Fit[\/p][\/td][td][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/276a45e57b6590e7e02d1a8f5638bc06fb57a8d0.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"185\"][p]\u200b[b]Region: [\/b]EU[b]\nServer: [\/b]Kromede[b]\nCharacter[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name: [\/b]Arynavi[\/p][\/td][td][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/2d52a72a95facf869309d3b4fc78366760c1e322.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][\/table][h2]\n\n[u]Beauty of Atreia (Pets)[\/u][\/h2][p]The last week was about your favorite companion![\/p][table equalcells=\"1\" colwidth=\"209,\"][tr][th colwidth=\"209\"][p]Winner[\/p][\/th][th][p]Submission[\/p][\/th][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"209\"][p]\u200b[b]Region: [\/b]NA East  \n[b]Server: [\/b]Siel \n[b]Character[\/b]\u00a0[b]Name: [\/b]Mooniie[\/p][\/td][td][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46074831\/0f3c350b438e0513dd4d4b578b40668060574233.png\"][\/img][\/p][\/td][\/tr][tr][td colwidth=\"209\"][p]\u200b[b]Re