				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/957bb1e00bf3d05fcb615809f134a1aa.avif?t=1792771538" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras_big/957bb1e00bf3d05fcb615809f134a1aa.avif?t=1792771538 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>AION 2 is now LIVE!</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >As a thank you to all Daevas, we are extending all Pre-Registration and Steam Wishlist reward items to every player who creates an account and logs in before maintenance begins on Dec 1, 11:30 PM PT / Dec 2, 8:30 AM CET. Simply log in and your rewards will be delivered to your in-game mail. Remember to claim them before the mail expires on Dec 8, 11:30 PM PT / Dec 9, 8:30 AM CET.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/acc21381e08a7b9341842ec99750409f.poster.avif?t=1792771538" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/acc21381e08a7b9341842ec99750409f.webm?t=1792771538" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/acc21381e08a7b9341842ec99750409f.mp4?t=1792771538" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The sky is not the limit. It is the battlefield.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Built on Unreal Engine 5 across a world 36 times larger than the original AION, this is the only MMORPG built for aerial combat. Verticality is in the DNA of AION 2, and rewards players who can think, and fight, in 3 dimensions.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/abd6cf12834cb44ee11891e858143ffd.avif?t=1792771538" width=780 height=103 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/fb145482ea01038473b2e3e384c4406c.poster.avif?t=1792771538" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/fb145482ea01038473b2e3e384c4406c.webm?t=1792771538" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/fb145482ea01038473b2e3e384c4406c.mp4?t=1792771538" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every region, every battlefield, every encounter was designed with verticality as its axis. As a Daeva, flight is not a travel mechanic, it is how you fight, how you explore, and how you impose your will on the world. Gain altitude to gain advantage, and experience a scale of aerial combat unlike any other MMORPG.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/da4ce2c604b441091b8caffa29e626cd.avif?t=1792771538" width=780 height=103 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/0f10240b3d6741b24113de2aaf19455e.poster.avif?t=1792771538" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/0f10240b3d6741b24113de2aaf19455e.webm?t=1792771538" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/0f10240b3d6741b24113de2aaf19455e.mp4?t=1792771538" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Precision, timing, and positioning shape every battle. Chain skills seamlessly, customize your class to fit your playstyle, and adapt as encounters escalate. Every fight is a decision, not a rotation. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/b1685df031c58f89cb12fd57ec559f84.avif?t=1792771538" width=780 height=103 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/05ff38c9eb4b9fca4e1275039049c732.poster.avif?t=1792771538" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/05ff38c9eb4b9fca4e1275039049c732.webm?t=1792771538" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/05ff38c9eb4b9fca4e1275039049c732.mp4?t=1792771538" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >From solo instances to large-scale raids, AION 2 PvE is built around scale and variety. Over 200 dungeons span multiple formats: solo challenges, 5-player party content, and 10-player group dungeons. Seasonal challenges, competitive rankings, and open-world events keep the excitement high, and the Abyss ensures that PvE and faction war are never far apart. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/4716c617dbbba56d14c75f08740e5ceb.avif?t=1792771538" width=780 height=103 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/2950d6813001bb33367fddb0e6124c3c.poster.avif?t=1792771538" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/2950d6813001bb33367fddb0e6124c3c.webm?t=1792771538" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/2950d6813001bb33367fddb0e6124c3c.mp4?t=1792771538" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Bring your vision to life with one of the most advanced character creation systems in an MMORPG. With over 200 customization options and countless outfits, mounts, and wings to collect, your character becomes a true expression of who you are. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/7f581301fa1af214b4a6c46e254862c5.avif?t=1792771538" width=780 height=103 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/141080b1a0c1fb99b246778bed8ce999.poster.avif?t=1792771538" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/141080b1a0c1fb99b246778bed8ce999.webm?t=1792771538" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393110/extras/141080b1a0c1fb99b246778bed8ce999.mp4?t=1792771538" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Shugo Festival brings a variety of mini-games to Atreia. Protect the Shugos from waves of enemies, race pets against other players, dodge lasers, and more. Earn unique rewards including wings, skins, pets, and décor!</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
