							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 5 2600 / Intel® Core™ i5-10500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Recommended. When using FHD resolution in-game, set the graphics preset to Very Low to ensure compatibility.</li></ul>							</ul>
